{"id":"a51b88c3e3a72ba5","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-term.md","title":"一阶项的有限阶段构造","display":"df-term — 一阶项的有限阶段构造","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-term","aliases":["18-df-term"],"display":"df-term — 一阶项的有限阶段构造","depends_on":["[[18-df-symbol-alphabet]]","[[18-df-variable]]"],"source_correspondence":"本地依赖补全","local_revision":"2026-10-14","verification_status":"local-mathematical-reconstruction; not-machine-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-term"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-term</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-term — 一阶项的有限阶段构造"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca728af2af9b9d11\" href=\"?note=ca728af2af9b9d11\" title=\"18-df-symbol-alphabet\">18-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"adee8e90809320b8\" href=\"?note=adee8e90809320b8\" title=\"18-df-variable\">18-df-variable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"本地依赖补全"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-mathematical-reconstruction; not-machine-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,V,C,F_n\">\\(S,V,C,F_n\\)</span> 及构造子见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca728af2af9b9d11\" href=\"?note=ca728af2af9b9d11\" title=\"18-df-symbol-alphabet\">18-df-symbol-alphabet</a>，变量接口见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"adee8e90809320b8\" href=\"?note=adee8e90809320b8\" title=\"18-df-variable\">18-df-variable</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_S=V\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_S=V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,n\\in\\omega\">\\(j,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；函数符号仅在其指定元数上应用。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,c,f(\\vec t)\">\\(x,c,f(\\vec t)\\)</span> 采用字母表节点的项位置显示约定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal T_{S,0}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf{var}(x):x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\mathsf{con}(c):c\\in C\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal T_{S,j+1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal T_{S,j}\\cup\n\\{\\mathsf{app}(f,\\vec t):n\\ge1,\\ f\\in F_n,\\ \\vec t\\in\\mathcal T_{S,j}^{\\,n}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Term}_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j&lt;\\omega}\\mathcal T_{S,j},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Term}(S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Term}_S.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal T_{S,0}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf{var}(x):x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\mathsf{con}(c):c\\in C\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal T_{S,j+1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal T_{S,j}\\cup\n\\{\\mathsf{app}(f,\\vec t):n\\ge1,\\ f\\in F_n,\\ \\vec t\\in\\mathcal T_{S,j}^{\\,n}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Term}_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j&lt;\\omega}\\mathcal T_{S,j},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Term}(S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Term}_S.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补齐原缺失 term 文件。构造只使用集合上的有限阶段并集；零元函数若需加入某语言，作为该语言的常元加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>。变量符号与变量项的代码由上游显示约定区分。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"ca728af2af9b9d11","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"adee8e90809320b8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor